  class: org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.escalation.GeneralExceptionHandler
```

**`org.springframework.security.authorization.AuthorizationDeniedException.yml`**
```yaml
handle:
  class: org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.escalation.ForbiddenExceptionHandler
```

### Exception structure — there is NO `OwnerNotFoundException`
"Not found" is a single generic exception used across all entities:

**`NotFoundException`** — `/home/daniel/.../src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/escalation/NotFoundException.java`
```java
package org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.escalation;

/**
 * Thrown by Load/Build functions when a requested entity does not exist.
 * Handled globally by {@link NotFoundExceptionHandler}, which responds 404 with an empty body.
 */
public class NotFoundException extends Exception {

    public NotFoundException(String message) {
        super(message);
    }
}
```

**`NotFoundExceptionHandler`** — same package
```java
public class NotFoundExceptionHandler {

    public void handle(@Parameter NotFoundException ex, ObjectResponse<ResponseEntity<Void>> response) {
        response.send(ResponseEntity.notFound().build());
    }
}
```
Responds 404 with an empty body.

It is thrown for owners via `LoadOwner` (`/home/daniel/.../rest/function/owner/LoadOwner.java`), which delegates to `Lookups.findOrNotFound(() -> ownerRepository.findById(ownerId), "Owner not found: " + ownerId)`.

**`ValidationExceptionHandler`** builds a `ProblemDetail` (400 Bad Request) with `title` = exception simple name and a `schemaValidationErrors` array of field-level errors. This is what the POST returns when `@Valid` fails.

**`DataIntegrityViolationExceptionHandler`** builds a `ProblemDetail` (NOTE: it returns `HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND`, not 409/422) for data constraint violations.

**`ProblemDetails`** helper — `/home/daniel/.../rest/escalation/ProblemDetails.java` — builds the common ProblemDetail body (type `about:blank`, `title` = `ex.getClass().getSimpleName()`, `detail`, `timestamp`, and empty `schemaValidationErrors`).

Other handlers present: `GeneralExceptionHandler`, `ForbiddenExceptionHandler` (paths in the same escalation package).

## 6. Tests related to creating owners

**Path:** `/home/daniel/.../src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1Tests.java`

